            "value": "相机未开启，因此镜头和相机数值未更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "相機未開啟，因此鏡頭和相機數值未更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera isn't sending a picture.": {
      "comment": "Shown over the viewfinder when the camera runs but every picture it delivers is blank, even after the app restarted the camera.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Kamera liefert kein Bild."
