    "Use a tripod. Turn on Magnify to check focus on a bright star or a distant light, and fine-tune it with the Focus control.": {
      "comment": "Tip in the night sky helper's settings. Magnify and Focus are the names of the camera's focus magnifier and manual focus control.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Verwende ein Stativ. Schalte „Vergrößern“ ein, um den Fokus an einem hellen Stern oder einem entfernten Licht zu prüfen, und stelle ihn mit „Fokus“ fein ein."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usa un trípode. Activa Ampliar para comprobar el enfoque en una estrella brillante o una luz lejana, y ajústalo con el control Enfoque."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Utilisez un trépied. Activez Agrandir pour vérifier la mise au point sur une étoile brillante ou une lumière lointaine, puis affinez-la avec la commande Mise au point."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Usa un treppiede. Attiva Ingrandisci per controllare la messa a fuoco su una stella luminosa o una luce lontana e regolala con il controllo Messa a fuoco."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "三脚を使ってください。「拡大」をオンにして明るい星や遠くの光でピントを確認し、「フォーカス」で微調整します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "삼각대를 사용하세요. 확대를 켜고 밝은 별이나 멀리 있는 불빛으로 초점을 확인한 다음 초점 조절로 미세 조정하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Gebruik een statief. Zet Vergroten aan om de focus te controleren op een heldere ster of een ver licht, en stel hem fijn af met Focus."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Use um tripé. Ative Ampliar para verificar o foco em uma estrela brilhante ou uma luz distante e ajuste-o com o controle Foco."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "请使用三脚架。打开“放大”，在一颗亮星或远处的灯光上检查对焦，再用“对焦”控制微调。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "請使用三腳架。開啟「放大」，在明亮的星星或遠處的燈光上檢查對焦，再用「對焦」控制微調。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
